@startuml
' microblx block life-cycle FSM.
' Regenerate the SVG with:  plantuml -tsvg life_cycle.puml
hide empty description
title microblx block life-cycle

[*] --> preinit : <color:RoyalBlue>ubx_block_create()</color>\n<color:RoyalBlue>apply_config #1 (static / meta)</color>\n<color:DarkGreen>preinit()</color>

preinit --> inactive : <color:RoyalBlue>apply_config #2 (preinit-created)</color>\n<color:DarkGreen>init()</color>\n<color:RoyalBlue>reapply_config #3 (init-created)</color>
inactive --> preinit  : <color:DarkGreen>cleanup()</color>

inactive --> active : <color:DarkGreen>start()</color>
active --> inactive : <color:DarkGreen>stop()</color>

preinit --> [*] : <color:DarkGreen>preexit()</color>\n<color:RoyalBlue>ubx_block_rm()</color>

active : <color:DarkGreen>step()  /  read() / write()</color>

legend bottom
  <color:RoyalBlue>**blue**</color> = framework / external step (API call, config apply)
  <color:DarkGreen>**green**</color> = block hook (transition effect, never entry/exit)
endlegend
@enduml
